scenario the position walks away from a wrist that never moved
describe The canonical detector, and the reason ADR-0011 names the BMA423. A
describe still wrist is genuinely still, so a position that walks off is
describe evidence in a way it could not be on a device that cannot tell.
describe The receiver reports nothing wrong throughout, which is the point.

at 0
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion still
  expect trust trusted

at 60000
  fix 3d
  pos 5000900 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion still
  expect trust trusted             # about 10 m; within the noise of a fix

# About 190 m, over two minutes: 1.6 m/s, which is a walk. No speed problem at
# all, and the threshold for a jump-while-still is 50 m. The wrist says nobody
# walked it.
at 180000
  fix 3d
  pos 5018000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion still
  expect trust degraded
  expect reason motion-disagreement
  expect no-reason implausible-speed
  expect no-reason position-jump
